{"title":"1966 AHSME Problems/Problem 16","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/2/d/92dd14dde7e758e3a999fefac8abbdbeb48b7cf3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{4^x}{2^{x+y}}=8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"71\" height=\"37\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/3/2a3e05d1f6a2670f3584a8c1ea82858f0fdf8ddd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{9^{x+y}}{3^{5y}}=243$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"89\" height=\"38\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> real numbers, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/7/3f79c3676b62fb47243e0d357c87115b6f3395e4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$xy$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"22\" height=\"13\" /> equals:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/5/895363f50432250c88d332ea18173bdf97c3e949.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A) } \\frac{12}{5} \\quad \\text{(B) } 4 \\quad \\text{(C) } 6 \\quad \\text{(D)} 12 \\quad \\text{(E) } -4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"303\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/8/5/28542398917620d2d542cee18fe1106b16f952a7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{4^x}{2^{x+y}}=8\\implies 4^x = 2^{x+y+3}\\implies 2x=x+y+3 \\implies x = y+3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"506\" height=\"37\" />.\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/e/9ee593c2dd1ab05b2e2cdce64d3ba36f0b156cab.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{9^{x+y}}{3^{5y}}=243\\implies 9^{x+y}=3^{5y+5}\\implies 2x+2y=5y+5\\implies 2x = 3y +5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"566\" height=\"38\" />.\nSo, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/b/5/8b58b721256e31d6643ea079bfafb3532ebd237a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2y+6=3y+5\\implies y = 1 \\implies x = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"309\" height=\"16\" />. Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/c/27cf2b6cca90cd7da78b22bde20f42f6def98946.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$xy = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"53\" height=\"15\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/c/13c3218ca790f4eac4048f34f68433655b19e1f4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\fbox{B}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME\" title=\"1966 AHSME\">1966 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1966 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1966 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1966\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1966 AHSME Problems/Problem 15\">Problem 15</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"1966 AHSME Problems/Problem 17\">Problem 17</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1966 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1966 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1966 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1966 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1966 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1966 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1966 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1966 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1966 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1966 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/i